#   - replaces /public/favicon.svg with the Trevo clover-green placeholder mark
#   - adds shared components: Header, Alert, LoadingState, trevo-logo.svg asset
#   - restyles every src/pages/*.jsx page to use the new tokens and components
#   - preserves all functionality, hooks, i18n keys, and routes
#
# Note: this is a full-file-replacement patch (each hunk replaces the entire
# file). That makes the diff large but unambiguous; `git apply` consumes it
# the same way as a granular diff.

